        "content": "\n\n```python\ndef uncovered_spans(bounds, intervals):\n    lo, hi = bounds\n    if lo >= hi:\n        return []\n    \n    # Filter and clamp intervals\n    clamped = []\n    for start, end in intervals:\n        if start >= end:\n            continue\n        # Clamp to [lo, hi)\n        s = max(start, lo)\n        e = min(end, hi)\n        if s < e:\n            clamped.append((s, e))\n            \n    # Sort by start time, then by end time\n    clamped.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1]))\n    \n    result = []\n    current_pos = lo\n    \n    for start, end in clamped:\n        if start > current_pos:\n            result.append((current_pos, start))\n        if end > current_pos:\n            current_pos = end\n            \n    if current_pos < hi:\n        result.append((current_pos, hi))\n        \n    return result\n```",
